        "bio-long": "<p>Magnus 🐻‍❄️ Waffles is a Samoyed from Copenhagen who supervises the household's travel. Veteran of a fourteen-day, twelve-country EV road trip across the Balkans, where he operated strictly in an advisory capacity.</p><p>Often confused with a polar bear, seal, or teddy bear. 100% Samoyed.</p><p>Has located a full baguette on a sidewalk in more than one country. Chose his own baked goods at a Budapest dog bakery. Regretted nothing. Polar bear by appearance, supervisor by profession.</p>",
